https://github.com/databendlabs/databend/issues/20626 已fixed 

DROP DATABASE IF EXISTS repro_databend917_db2_min;
CREATE DATABASE repro_databend917_db2_min;
USE repro_databend917_db2_min;

CREATE TABLE source (
    vp_rowid BIGINT NOT NULL,
    c0map MAP(VARCHAR, BIGINT) NULL
) ENGINE=FUSE;

CREATE TABLE left_part (
    vp_rowid BIGINT NOT NULL
) ENGINE=FUSE;

CREATE TABLE right_part (
    vp_rowid BIGINT NOT NULL,
    c0map MAP(VARCHAR, BIGINT) NULL
) ENGINE=FUSE;

INSERT INTO source VALUES
(1, {'x':1}),
(2, NULL),
(3, {'x':2}),
(4, NULL);

INSERT INTO left_part
SELECT vp_rowid FROM source;

INSERT INTO right_part
SELECT vp_rowid, c0map FROM source;

SELECT COUNT(source.c0map)
FROM source
LIMIT 2;

SELECT COUNT(s.c0map)
FROM (
    SELECT l.vp_rowid, r.c0map
    FROM left_part l
    LEFT JOIN right_part r
        ON l.vp_rowid = r.vp_rowid
) s
LIMIT 2;

左右表重构查询正确返回 2，因为 MAP 列只有两行非 NULL。单表 source 查询错误地返回 4

单表 EXPLAIN：
EvalScalar
├── output columns: [COUNT(source.c0map)]
├── expressions: [4]
└── Limit
    ├── limit: 2
    └── DummyTableScan
单表 COUNT(source.c0map) 返回 4 推测可能是因为优化器错误地把 COUNT(c0map) 折叠成了 COUNT(*) / 表行数常量，丢掉了 MAP 列的 NULL 过滤语义。
重构查询 EXPLAIN：
Limit
├── output columns: [COUNT(s.c0map)]
├── limit: 2
└── AggregateFinal
    ├── group by: []
    ├── aggregate functions: [count(c0map)]
    └── AggregatePartial
        ├── group by: []
        ├── aggregate functions: [count(c0map)]
        └── HashJoin
            ├── join type: LEFT OUTER
            ├── build keys: [right_part.vp_rowid]
            ├── probe keys: [left_part.vp_rowid]
            ├── TableScan(Build)
            │   └── output columns: [vp_rowid, c0map]
            └── TableScan(Probe)
                └── output columns: [vp_rowid]

重构版本因为 LEFT JOIN 后列可空性变化，阻止了这个错误优化，所以返回正确的 2。